          "semantic": "非原子引用计数智能指针：clone() 增计数，最后一份释放时按要求调用 drop；!Send，不可跨线程",
          "example": "let a = rc(Point(x: 1, y: 2))"
        },
        {
          "index": 49,
          "word": "arc",
          "kind": "identifier",
          "category": "内存",
          "position": 5,
          "form": "arc[T]；arc(值)",
          "semantic": "原子引用计数智能指针：T: Send + Sync 时整体 Send + Sync；跨线程共享所有权，通常包 mutex 使用",
          "example": "let a = arc(mutex(0))"
        },
        {
          "index": 50,
          "word": "gc",
          "kind": "identifier",
          "category": "内存",
          "position": 6,
          "form": "gc[T]；gc(值)",
          "semantic": "GC 托管的堆对象：仅当 --gc 不为 none 且处于 --app 模式可用；--bare 下使用是编译错误；GC 对象不参与确定性析构（drop 至多调一次）",
          "example": "let node = gc(Node(next: none))"
        },
        {
          "index": 51,
          "word": "ptr",
          "kind": "identifier",
          "category": "内存",
          "position": 7,
          "form": "ptr[T]；ptr mut T",
          "semantic": "带类型原始指针：解引用需 @unsafe；ptr + 整数 运算需 @unsafe；可空性用 opt[ptr[T]]；不参与借用检查，不与 ref 混用",
          "example": "@unsafe { let v = *p }"
        },
        {
          "index": 52,
          "word": "ref",
          "kind": "identifier",
          "category": "内存",
          "position": 8,
          "form": "ref T；ref mut T",
          "semantic": "借用引用（非拥有）：受所有权与别名规则约束（同一时刻 1×ref mut 或 N×ref）；宽度同指针；不能逃逸出被借用值的生命周期",
          "example": "fn len(s: ref [i32]) -> usize"
        },
        {
          "index": 53,
          "word": "mut",
          "kind": "identifier",
          "category": "内存",
          "position": 9,
          "form": "ref mut T；ptr mut T；mut self；mut 参数",
          "semantic": "可变性修饰：只用于借用、指针与接收者，表示\"可写视图\"；变量本身的可变性由 var 声明，因此不存在 let mut 写法",
          "example": "fn clear(mut self) { }"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "裸机",
      "count": 7,
      "keywords": [
        {
          "index": 54,
          "word": "@",
          "kind": "symbol",
          "category": "裸机",
          "position": 1,
          "form": "@属性；@属性(参数)；@属性 { ... }",
          "semantic": "属性/注解前缀，可作用于项、语句、类型与表达式；内建属性：@inline @no_mangle @entry @section(\"..\") @at(地址) @irq(向量) @repr(C) @packed @align(n) @volatile @unsafe @allocator；@unsafe { } 是**不安全块**（解引用 ptr、asm、访问 static mut、volatile 读写、goto 目标校验之外的指针算术必须位于其中）；attr 声明的自定义属性同样以 @ 使用",
          "example": "@inline fn hot() {}"
        },
        {
          "index": 55,
          "word": "asm",
          "kind": "identifier",
          "category": "裸机",
          "position": 2,
          "form": "asm \"模板\"；asm { \"模板\", out(..), in(..), clobber(\"..\") }",
          "semantic": "内联汇编：必须位于 @unsafe 上下文；asm 可作为表达式产出寄存器值（out 绑定）；模板原样交给目标汇编器，不做转义；--bare 下始终可用，wasm 目标下是编译错误",
          "example": "@unsafe { asm \"nop\" }"
        },
        {
          "index": 56,
          "word": "volatile",
          "kind": "identifier",
          "category": "裸机",
          "position": 3,
          "form": "类型位置 volatile 类型；属性 @volatile",
          "semantic": "易失访问修饰：作用于 ptr/raw，读写不可被优化、合并、消除或重排；用于 MMIO 寄存器；对非指针类型使用是编译错误",
          "example": "let reg: volatile ptr[u32] = 0x4000_0000 as volatile ptr[u32]"
        },
        {
          "index": 57,
          "word": "at",
          "kind": "identifier",
          "category": "裸机",
          "position": 4,
          "form": "项声明尾部 ... at 常量地址；等价属性 @at(常量地址)",
          "semantic": "地址放置子句：把 static/fn 放到固定地址（由链接脚本转成段+偏移）；只允许常量地址；与 --bare 配合",
          "example": "fn reset() at 0x0000_0000 { }"
        },
        {
          "index": 58,
          "word": "irq",
          "kind": "identifier",
          "category": "裸机",
          "position": 5,
          "form": "irq fn 名(参数) { ... }；配合 @irq(向量号)",
          "semantic": "声明中断服务例程：dscc 生成上下文保存/恢复与中断返回序列；ISR 内禁止阻塞原语（wait/recv/send/mutex.lock）；向量号用 @irq(n) 绑定或由中断表 @irq_table 统一注册",
          "example": "@irq(5) irq fn timer_tick() { }"
        },
        {
          "index": 59,
          "word": "section",
          "kind": "identifier",
          "category": "裸机",
          "position": 6,
          "form": "section \"段名\" { 项... }",
          "semantic": "段放置块：块内所有项进入指定链接段（.boot/.text/.rodata/.bss 等）；段名原样交给链接器；--app 下同样生效（自定义段）",
          "example": "section \".boot\" { fn _start() { } }"
        },
        {
          "index": 60,
          "word": "packed",
          "kind": "identifier",
          "category": "裸机",
          "position": 7,
          "form": "packed type 名 { ... }；等价属性 @packed",
          "semantic": "紧凑布局：无填充，alignof(T) == 1（除非另加 @align(n)）；非对齐字段访问由 dscc 生成逐字节序列，或按目标能力产出单指令",
          "example": "packed type Header { magic: u16, len: u32 }"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
