          "word": "macro",
          "kind": "identifier",
          "category": "元编程",
          "position": 2,
          "form": "macro 名(参数: 语法片段) { 模板 }",
          "semantic": "语法宏：解析期展开、默认卫生（模板内新标识符不与调用点冲突）；片段类型为 expr/type/pat/stmt/block/ident/lit；与 comptime fn 分工——macro 操作语法，comptime fn 操作值/类型",
          "example": "macro unless(c: expr, b: block) { if !c { b } }"
        },
        {
          "index": 63,
          "word": "typeinfo",
          "kind": "identifier",
          "category": "元编程",
          "position": 3,
          "form": "typeinfo(类型)；typeinfo::of(表达式)",
          "semantic": "编译期类型反射：返回 TypeInfo（字段 name/size/align/fields/traits/kind）；comptime 中完全可用；运行期保留需 --rt full，否则是编译错误",
          "example": "comptime let n = typeinfo(T).name"
        },
        {
